# Per-product settings sourced by kiosk-start.sh.
#
# Deliberately no KIOSK_URL: the kiosk always starts on this device's own local
# app (http://localhost/kiosk). On a fresh device that runs the first-run wizard
# — Wi-Fi, then which Relief Inventory server this device belongs to — and once
# setup is done the local app sends the browser to that server. The server's
# address is chosen on the device, saved under /data, and is not part of the
# image: see platform/docs/SERVER_URL.md. (A remote KIOSK_URL here would skip the
# wizard altogether, Wi-Fi setup included.)
